---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro'
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy of Globaal Elevate Production s.r.o. — what personal data we process, why, and what rights you have."
  badge="• Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lead="Your privacy matters to us. Here you will find what personal data we process, why, and what rights you have."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="section gdpr-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="gdpr-wrap">

        <p class="updated">Effective / last updated: 8 July 2026</p>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
          <p>The data controller is <strong>Globaal Elevate Production s.r.o.</strong>, company ID&nbsp;24972070, registered office Dlouhá&nbsp;715/38, Staré Město, 110&nbsp;00 Prague&nbsp;1, Czech Republic, entered in the Commercial Register under file number C&nbsp;446827, Municipal Court in Prague.</p>
          <p>Contact for data protection matters: <a href="mailto:info@globaalelevate.com">info@globaalelevate.com</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>2. What data we process</h2>
          <p>We only process data that you provide to us yourself through the forms on the website:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> name, email, topic and message content.</li>
            <li><strong>Newsletter subscription:</strong> email address.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> anonymous, cookieless website traffic measurement (without identifying a specific person).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>3. Purposes and legal basis for processing</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Handling enquiries / collaboration / booking</strong> — the legal basis is the controller's legitimate interest in handling an enquiry or request that you initiated yourself (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
            <li><strong>Sending the newsletter</strong> — based on your consent (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(a) GDPR), which you can withdraw at any time.</li>
            <li><strong>Website security and operation</strong> — we process IP addresses for a short time to protect forms from spam and to diagnose technical errors. The legal basis is the controller's legitimate interest (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>4. Recipients and processors</h2>
          <p>We do not share personal data with anyone other than the necessary service providers who process it on our behalf:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Resend</strong> (Resend, Inc., USA) — delivery of emails from forms and the newsletter.</li>
            <li><strong>Vercel</strong> (Vercel, Inc., USA) — website hosting and operation.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>5. Transfers outside the EU</h2>
          <p>Some processors (Resend, Vercel) may process data outside the EU/EEA (in particular in the USA). In such cases the transfer is secured by EU Standard Contractual Clauses or another appropriate mechanism under the GDPR.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>6. Retention period</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Enquiries and communication:</strong> 1 year from the last communication.</li>
            <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> until consent is withdrawn.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
          <p>In relation to your personal data, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>access your data and obtain a copy,</li>
            <li>rectification of inaccurate data,</li>
            <li>erasure (the right to be forgotten),</li>
            <li>restriction of processing,</li>
            <li>data portability,</li>
            <li>object to processing,</li>
            <li>withdraw your consent at any time (without affecting the lawfulness of prior processing).</li>
          </ul>
          <p>You can exercise your rights by emailing <a href="mailto:info@globaalelevate.com">info@globaalelevate.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>8. Right to lodge a complaint</h2>
          <p>If you believe that we are violating the GDPR by processing your data, you have the right to lodge a complaint with the supervisory authority — the <strong>Office for Personal Data Protection</strong> (Úřad pro ochranu osobních údajů), Pplk. Sochora 27, 170&nbsp;00 Prague&nbsp;7, Czech Republic, <a href="https://www.uoou.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.uoou.cz</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
          <p>The website uses only anonymous, cookieless traffic measurement without storing cookies in your browser. We do not use any advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- NEWSLETTER_GDPR_SECTION -->
        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>10. Newsletter</h2>
          <p><strong>Purpose of processing:</strong> sending a newsletter with news about projects, events, new music and behind-the-scenes of Globaal Elevate Production.</p>
          <p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> consent of the data subject (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You give consent actively by completing and submitting the sign-up form and confirming the link in the email (double opt-in). Consent is voluntary and can be withdrawn at any time.</p>
          <p><strong>Data processed:</strong> email address, time and source of consent (sign-up form or other source), time of subscription confirmation.</p>
          <p><strong>Processor:</strong> Resend, Inc., USA — email delivery platform. The transfer of data to a third country (USA) is secured by EU Standard Contractual Clauses. Current data protection information: <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">resend.com/legal/privacy-policy</a>.</p>
          <p><strong>Retention period:</strong> until consent is withdrawn. After unsubscribing, the data is marked as unsubscribed in the Resend system; on request it is permanently deleted.</p>
          <p><strong>How to withdraw consent:</strong> by clicking the unsubscribe link in every newsletter sent, or by email to <a href="mailto:info@globaalelevate.com">info@globaalelevate.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gdpr-block">
          <h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy. The current version is always available on this page with the effective date.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .gdpr-section {
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .gdpr-wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .updated {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .gdpr-block {
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .gdpr-block:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .gdpr-block h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .gdpr-block ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .gdpr-block a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .gdpr-block a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--fg);
  }
</style>
